menuconfig ARCH_SC9820E
	bool "Unisoc SC9820E"
	depends on ARCH_MULTI_V7
	select ARM_AMBA
	select ARM_GIC
	select ARM_GIC_V3
	select ARM_PSCI
	select HAVE_ARM_ARCH_TIMER
	help
	  Enable the native Device Tree machine for SC9820E ARM systems.
	  The target supplies peripheral resources and board wiring in Device Tree.
	  Interrupts, PSCI and the architectural timer use generic ARM drivers.
	  Peripherals marked inherited require state from the RAM boot path.
